<p>Hi, I’m Graxonus. I found out about SCP via Containment breach, and then started to dig deeper into the Foundation’s lore. Fairly soon, I discovered the site, and I loved it. So then I thought, “why not join it?” And so I did. I joined in explorer primarily because I want to mostly do feedback and things like that, and then contribute when I feel the article is good enough or I have enough free time to draft one up. My hobbies are reading, studying history, video games and swimming. I particularly love swimming, even though I am ironically allergic to salt water, meaning I can never really swim in the sea for longer than 5 minutes. Random thoughts that keep me up at night are, “what if I fail at college?” And very often thoughts of my late grandfather. Fun fact about me, I am very dark and morbid. Not depressing or depressed, just dark.</p>

