<p>I can see that potentially working, given enough time between the &quot;human reveal&quot; and the final one. I do, however, have a question about this part.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Mid way/near the end of the article a site administrator establishes a connection with the sender of the signal by reverse engineering anomalous tech.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Is this anomalous tech related to the current situation, or is it completely separate? The latter has the potential to further complicate an already rather complex concept.</p>
<p>In addition to that, what happens with the actual threat mentioned in your pitch? If the Earth is still in danger of the same encroaching mass at the end of your article, you run the risk of leaving your reader feeling like there's something missing in your narrative.</p>

